  "finding": "Scene S005 depicts an honor guard firing a three-volley rifle salute in close proximity to attendees. If practical firearms or blanks are utilized on set, CSATF Safety Bulletin #1 specifies that production must conduct a safety meeting with all involved personnel including an on-site walk-through or dry run before any firearm is used, and that protective shields, eye and hearing protection, or other appropriate personal protective equipment shall be issued and utilized by all personnel in close proximity or directly in the line of fire.",
